<h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your {{platformName}} account. If you made this request, please click the button below to set a new password:</p>

{{> button url=resetUrl text="Reset Password"}}

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #DC2626; background-color: #FEF2F2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #FEE2E2;">
  <strong>Important:</strong> For security reasons, this link will expire in 15 minutes.
</p>

<p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged, and your account is secure.</p>
<p>Thank you,<br><strong>{{platformName}} Security Team</strong></p>
